{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110706","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110706/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110706/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110706/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110706","id":3436039423,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7Mzcz_","number":110706,"title":"TextureStorage::texture_debug_usage and MeshStorage::mesh_debug_usage are not thread-safe","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-09-19T22:10:13Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T08:56:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- current master @ 3c9d03b8755968ae305b8cfebe886c56402cb044\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS Sequoia (15.6.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M4 Max (Apple9) - Apple M4 Max (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\ntexture_debug_usage and mesh_debug_usage are not thread-safe. While `get_owned_list()` is thread-safe, iterating through the list is not. The mutex is not held while iterating through the list, which means that textures/meshes can be freed during iteration, which can lead to a segfault when de-referencing them while populating the info objects.\n\nThis can be likely be fixed by just locking the mutex before iterating through the list.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. constantly call either function on a task thread while loading and unloading scenes on the main thread\n2. Eventually, you'll get a segfault.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110706/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110706/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}